{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/221","id":4827211700,"node_id":"PR_kwDORoMukM8AAAABH7lntA","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/221","diff_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/221.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/221.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/221","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/221/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/221/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/221/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/statuses/385e6919c44cc280266f9fe8c7105f379d45872f","number":221,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(marketplace): prepare HTML Guide Kit contract and gates","user":{"login":"ranzuozhou","id":35538471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTM4NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35538471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou","html_url":"https://github.com/ranzuozhou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 变更摘要\n\n为 HTML Guide Kit 固定新建指南的 Read、显式调用和确认等待合同，新增 ADR、六组 PR2 阻断/PR3 扩展验收判准、阶段 RUNBOOK；预留提交 scope 与独立版本工具支持，缺 manifest 仍失败零写入。check/smoke 兼容入口复用既有检查并保留参数透传。\n\n已普通 merge 最新 develop `f64fc957b9fa595ac483724e2f60c1314b276574`（#216），解决 CHANGELOG Added 与 INDEX 当前事项的冲突，完整保留两项功能合同和索引。INDEX 为 v2.14，四份 Learning Evidence 专属文档/回执与上游 Git blob 一致。其条件发布授权仍限定于 #209；HTML #217 的范围继续为 develop 工程实施。\n\n## 影响范围与阶段\n\n这是 PR1，运行仍为三插件、四公开技能、三个自然启用技能和 20 项仓库开发技能；marketplace 8.1.2，Diagram 0.3.1 / Understanding 0.1.2 / Explain 0.1.1。未新增 runtime 登记或空插件目录。\n\nOwner 已明确选择第二轮 A「HTML 教材」，准确候选与回复依据见 `assets/brand/html-guide-kit/candidates/revision-2/selection.json`。正式 SVG/1024 PNG、完整技能/两参考/显式策略/manifest/包文档在仓库外暂存，PNG 与所选候选字节一致，尚未安装或行为验收。\n\nPR2 从本 PR 实际合并后的最新 develop 派生，初始 draft，完整包/所选图标/登记/严格合同/安装和字节校验原子接入；六组真实连续模型行为通过后解除 draft。PR3 完成扩展、新插件双客户端交互和实际 merge 复验。现实场景效果按 Owner 决定另测，NOT_MEASURED。\n\n## 自检结果\n\n- [x] runtime 集合、manifest、登记与既有版本保持；版本工具缺 manifest 的真实 dry-run/apply 均失败零写入。\n- [x] 未来技能静态 YAML、唯一入口、false 策略及相对资源定位已核对，不计行为 PASS。\n- [x] 文档 metadata/链接、INDEX、根 AGENTS A6、CHANGELOG 和历史披露有效。\n- [x] 无新增运行路径依赖、凭据或调试产物；研究项目保持只读。\n- [x] 新提交符合约定并使用 Refs；没有重写历史或强制推送。\n- [x] 两块冲突逐项保留双方意图，无未解决 conflict marker。\n\n## 可复现验证\n\n- 同步后 npm test：强制 REQUIRE_PWSH=1 / REQUIRE_PYTHON=1，252/252 PASS，0 skip。\n- npm run validate：ok=true，四公开技能、20 项仓库开发技能。\n- npm run check：Codex CLI 0.147.0 精确基线通过。\n- npm run smoke：原四组安装实际通过；三个含 Diagram 场景实际运行安装缓存 Python，扫描 1、FAIL 0 / WARN 0。\n- 同步 merge `6d40991e56829c406d911b550de5c0bb9bf2195e` / tree `37e0b24ec3559ce3aeaac2f19467363f42a90e9e` 的完整 canonical 严格校验和四组实际安装再次通过。\n- 最终 head `385e6919c44cc280266f9fe8c7105f379d45872f` 相对上述已测 merge 只追加 RUNBOOK 和 canonical 原始 JSON。plugins tree 同为 `6e5d25bab77698a4cbdaa4616c3db237d9cd5de7`；43 项运行资源 SHA-256 与此前一致，登记、版本、执行脚本和 npm 配置未变，最终结构再次通过，复用安装证据。\n\n证据位于 `docs/runbook/[RUNBOOK]_HTML_Guide_Kit_Acceptance.md` 和 `docs/runbook/evidence/html-guide-kit/`，包含本轮 `pr1-develop-sync-checks.json`、测试日志与 `pr1-sync-canonical-install.json`。此前文档未落地的缺链失败、图标第一轮未选和各未执行项继续保留，不追认 PASS。\n\n## AI 判断、限制与合并条件\n\n独立只读双轴审查未发现实质合并问题，意见不替代 GitHub 批准。新插件行为/安装/客户端仍 NOT_RUN；本 PR 尚未合入，阶段 Issue 和 Epic 保持开放。\n\n当前 head 须满足真实 CI、非作者当前提交批准、strict base 与审查线程解决。不 bypass。满足后按已有授权合并 develop，核对实际 merge 并复验后显式关闭 #218；后续阶段仍按依赖推进。无 Release、发布 tag 或 main 发布 PR。\n\n回退通过新 PR 原子撤销对应前置或后续接入，保留历史证据。\n\n## Related STANDARDs\n\nDocumentation Framework、Commit Message Convention v1.5、AI Engineering Execution、Brand Identity，以及 HTML Guide Kit ADR/Acceptance SPEC。\n\nRefs: #217, #218, #219, #220\n","labels":[{"id":10504421502,"node_id":"LA_kwDORoMukM8AAAACchzAfg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/labels/feature","name":"feature","description":"新功能或需求变更","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12T09:05:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:35:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T09:35:44Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T09:35:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"70267a5b91d759af09a8f1281a33e2d5a90fdbc9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MJ-AgentLab:codex/html-guide-contract","ref":"codex/html-guide-contract","repo":{"id":1183002256,"node_id":"R_kgDORoMukA","name":"mj-agentlab-marketplace","full_name":"MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace","owner":{"login":"MJ-AgentLab","id":262496159,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6Vfnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262496159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc